WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:06.142
Welcome to ONE. This is a full tour of everything on your desktop, from the front door to the last setting.

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:19.491
This is vip50one.com. It's where new agents meet ONE: the five products, how they connect, and the packages.

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:27.639
Scroll down and you see each product in turn, and what ONE does for your relationships, your listings and your buyers.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:35.934
The packages are here: ONE Relationship, ONE Complete and Elite, with ONE Growth for leads.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:47.815
Signed in, vip50one.com always takes you straight to your Brain. That's where we'll spend the rest of this tour.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:51.707
Chapter 2. The Brain at a glance.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:01:00.152
This is your Brain: your whole business on one map. Gold ONE in the middle is Pulse, the A I that watches it all.

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:14.809
Round it sit ONE YOU, your Team, ONE MOVE, Marquee, Showly, ONE Open and ONE Growth. They're listed down the left too.

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:25.182
Every orb tells you how it's doing. Pulsing red means something needs you right now. Yellow means today. A still green ring means all good.

00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:33.795
The number on an orb is how many things inside it need you. Follow the pulse and it leads you straight to the person.

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:43.770
Click any orb and it comes to the middle, with its panel open on the right.

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:50.915
The ONE in the path line at the top takes you back to the whole map.

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:04.583
Zoom in and out with these buttons, to the right of the map on every screen. The circle brings you back to ONE.

00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:16.469
And the gold question mark opens the key to every light and colour, any time you need it.

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:27.427
Every colour and ring is written out here, with a two minute film below if you want it.

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:37.100
Chapter three. ONE Growth: leads from your own ads, at cost, with no per-lead fees.

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:44.866
ONE Growth is the lead side of ONE. Open it and its eight tools sit round it.

00:02:50.300 --> 00:02:56.955
Pulse Ads writes your ads and runs them on your own Meta and Google accounts, with the picture, the words and what each one costs.

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:10.277
Open it and every ad is there in full. Nothing runs until you approve it and press publish, and you pay the ad spend at cost.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:21.357
Farm areas gives each area you choose its own page, its ads and a monthly market note.

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:33.210
Landing pages: home value, buyer and seller guides, relocation, each with the leads it brought in.

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:44.764
Speed to lead: Pulse answers a new lead in seconds, in the mode you pick. Off, Ask me, or Autopilot.

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:55.534
Seller signals shows people who may sell soon, with the reasons, for you only.

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:09.783
The lead inbox turns your Zillow, Realtor dot com and Homes dot com lead emails into contacts. Pulse drafts the reply; you send it.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:21.391
Results shows your spend, leads, appointments and closings by source.

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:33.099
And team leads approve their agents' ad requests here. Every lead from your ads lands in ONE MOVE and pulses red until you reach it.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.865
Chapter 4. Morning Pulse.

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:47.192
Each morning Pulse greets you on the right: the three things that matter most today, and your whole day below.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:05:05.362
Press Play Morning Pulse and Pulse walks you through your morning. Since yesterday, two new leads came in, Rosa and Ken, and Pulse takes you straight to them.

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:15.345
A deal deadline is coming up too, for Ken. Each part takes you to the right place in your Brain.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:28.860
And Jen: it's her birthday, and she's one of your VIP-50. Pulse puts the call right in front of you.

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:40.996
Pause, skip, or turn the voice off any time. Close it and you're back on your map.

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:47.882
The gold pill at the top always tells you what to do right now, and until when.

00:05:55.280 --> 00:06:00.621
Click the gold ONE in the middle to meet Pulse: what it is doing for you now, and what is coming next.

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:08.403
Close it, and you are back on your map.

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:12.875
Chapter 5. Your day.

00:06:17.170 --> 00:06:21.842
Pulse plans your day round your calendar. Open ONE YOU, then Plan my day.

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:36.348
This is the Day Clock: today round a clock. Every colour is a kind of work. Calls gold, texts pink, face to face green, appointments blue.

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:44.568
On the right, every block has a time and a reason, fitted round your two appointments.

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:58.305
Your VIP touches are in it every day: the calls in your Power Hour, and one sitting for your texts, video texts and social touches.

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:10.713
Look it over and tap Looks good. Your plan is set, and it goes to ONE GO on your phone.

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:20.989
Through the day, tick each block done as you go. The Power Hour, done.

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:31.303
And the next one, done. The count goes up, and the clock fills in.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:37.041
Now say the morning runs away from you, and you miss a block.

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:49.032
Pulse moves it to the next open time by itself, and tells you, right here. Your fixed appointments never move.

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:59.317
Your calls happen in the Power Hour. Here it is, from ONE YOU.

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:12.741
Your best calls are lined up, most urgent first, each with why now: a birthday tomorrow, a thank you for a referral, a ninety day call.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:22.714
Pick how long, and start. The countdown runs while you call.

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:33.672
Jen first. You talked, so tap Talked. The call is logged in ONE MOVE, and Amy is next.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:46.104
Amy didn't pick up. Left a message, and on to Nina. You make every call; Pulse never dials or sends anything for you.

00:08:48.150 --> 00:08:53.533
Chapter six. ONE YOU: your own place to plan your week and see how you're doing.

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:03.403
ONE YOU's tools sit round it, and down the left. Each one shows you its own state before you open it.

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:17.741
Getting started walks a new agent through the first days, one step at a time. Each step ticks itself when ONE sees it done.

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:31.481
This week holds your commitments: up to five set on Monday and checked in on Friday, your daily ones, and your weekend ones.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:45.029
Each one is marked Kept, Partly or Missed when you check in. Only you and your coach see them, and your keep rate sits beside your weekly score.

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:58.819
Weekly Review puts your week in one place: your score, your VIP touches, who you haven't reached, your commitments and your goals.

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:11.237
Pulse reads your last eight weeks, then gives you three things for the rest of this week. Make any of them a commitment with one tap.

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:24.308
Today's VIP touches is your score for today, fourteen of twenty six points, and the people who matter most this week.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:35.936
Referrals shows who sent you business, who to thank, and who is likely to refer next.

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:53.051
David sent you a referral and you thanked him in person. Log the thank-you. Ann hasn't heard from you in fifty eight days: add a task to ask her. ONE sends nothing.

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:05.280
Habits are your morning habits as one ring. Tick Exercise here, and it ticks on your Daily Tracker too.

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:17.846
Scoreboard shows this week's missions, the leaderboard, and your accountability partners. It resets every Monday.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:28.483
Goals runs your own goal year: what you've closed so far against each goal, and whether you're ahead or behind pace.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:41.807
Below it, the next three months, with the people likely to close in each one, and what to do each week to close the gap.

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:53.008
reZEN brings in your revenue share and your network, only what you choose to let through in My Profile.

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:08.905
Coaching shows the agents you coach: who set their week, who checked in, how many they keep. The ones who need a word from you come first.

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:22.914
The 90-Day Challenge scores your day in five arenas, twenty points each: body, spirit, relationships, business and legacy.

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:34.361
And once a month, Ask AI about you checks whether ChatGPT, Perplexity and Google name you when clients ask for an agent.

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:41.942
Chapter seven. ONE MOVE: everyone you know, and everything you promised them.

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:53.233
Open ONE MOVE and its tools sit round it, with its menu down the left. People, Trackers, Events, Outreach and Learn each fold open.

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:03.667
Follow-ups come first: every promise you made, overdue, due today, and the next seven days.

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:11.687
Call Rosa back, then log the touch. The task closes itself.

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:20.236
People holds everyone you know. Contacts gathers them in groups round you.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:34.933
Click a group and its people gather round. Click a person and their whole story opens: family, favourites, your history, and what Pulse suggests saying.

00:13:39.850 --> 00:13:48.267
VIP Management shows your VIP-50 in the inner ring and your VIP-100 round it. Each face's ring is its touches this month.

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:59.781
Move someone up from the VIP one hundred in one tap, or swap them for someone in the VIP-50. Nobody is lost: they move to the outer ring.

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:19.386
Every VIP gets a call, a video text, a social touch, the newsletter and a mixer invite each month, and face to face, a note and a drop-by each quarter. The Touch Audit shows who is missing what.

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:27.298
See it as a ring or as a grid of every VIP and every touch.

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:43.927
Hot, Warm and Cold sorts every piece of business coming: Hot within three months, Warm three to twelve, Cold beyond. Each pulses until you've worked it today.

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:58.093
Opportunities gathers everything new that could become business. New to Sort holds new people waiting for a group.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:11.938
Looks Hot puts people Pulse thinks are ready in front of you, including people you know who came back to your website. Move them to Hot, or Not yet.

00:15:18.090 --> 00:15:23.573
New leads from your website, portals, ads and open houses stay red until you've reached each one.

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:35.689
Likely to move finds past clients who may be ready to buy or sell again, with the reasons.

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:49.029
Life events catches the big moments, a birthday, a new baby, a new job, with the touch Pulse suggests.

00:15:53.270 --> 00:16:03.157
Deals tracks every deal under contract and every REPC deadline, with the days left. Upload the signed REPC and Pulse fills in the dates for you to check.

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:14.733
The Business Rolodex holds the businesses you recommend. Share one with every VIP-50 agent if you like; your notes stay yours.

00:16:17.570 --> 00:16:23.606
Your trackers live here too. Tick a box on the Daily Tracker and the points add up toward your weekly hundred.

00:16:29.540 --> 00:16:36.056
Outreach holds your newsletter, market reports, action plans and landing pages, each with what it is doing now.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:44.851
An action plan's texts and emails never go out on their own. They wait as ready tasks until you switch them on.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:57.923
And Learn holds the video library, VIP docs and The Vault, searchable in one box.

00:16:59.640 --> 00:17:05.313
Chapter eight. Marquee: every listing's marketing, from the first presentation to the weekly seller report.

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:16.618
Open Marquee and its tools sit round it: your listings, the calendar, posts waiting, seller reports, presentations and room cards.

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:23.393
Listings shows every home you're marketing, and where each campaign stands.

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:34.558
Posts waiting holds what Marquee built for you: posts, stories and reels, each with its picture and caption.

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:45.971
Open them, and read each one. Nothing posts until you approve it and press publish.

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:56.123
The calendar puts every approved piece on its day.

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:07.840
Seller reports: answer six questions each week, and Marquee builds the report for your seller. You send it.

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:19.207
Presentations holds your listing appointment presentation and the marketing packet, built for each home.

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:31.093
And room cards: a card for each room, for the open house and the listing's room pages.

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:39.758
Chapter nine. Showly: buyer tours, with your clients answering yes, maybe or no on every home.

00:18:42.690 --> 00:18:46.902
Open Showly: your tours, your buyers' answers, the recaps and your lender.

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:59.812
Tours: one tour per showing day. Capture each home with photos and a voice note, then build the recap and send it.

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:12.215
Buyer answers: your buyers say yes, maybe or no on each home, with a note, the moment they open the recap.

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:24.102
Recaps is what your buyer sees on their phone: every home, your notes for them, and their answer.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:37.578
And your loan officer sits on every recap. Ask for a pre-approval letter for any home and see when it's ready. They never see your notes.

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:47.538
Chapter ten. ONE Open: the open house, from the plan to the last follow-up.

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:55.228
Open ONE Open: open houses, visitors, questions, reports, your scorecard and safety.

00:20:00.890 --> 00:20:05.890
Every open house runs in four phases, Plan, Prepare, Host and Follow Up, each with its checklist.

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:18.015
Visitors: everyone who signed in. Rate them, mark the hot ones, and they're in ONE MOVE, tagged by open house.

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:27.665
Questions: what buyers asked, room by room. Answer them here.

00:20:32.770 --> 00:20:37.237
Reports: the seller report, the seller recap, and a buyer report for each visitor.

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:47.021
The scorecard follows open houses to sign-ins, contacts, appointments and clients.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:56.252
And safety: start a check-in when you host. If you don't check out on time, your buddy is told.

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.220
Chapter 11. Ask Pulse.

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:12.314
The bar at the top is Ask Pulse. Ask anything about your business, in your own words.

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:24.836
Pulse looks through your real records and answers, and the people come up as orbs, with a call button for each.

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:33.854
Ask about your pipeline, your birthdays this month, your open house visitors, or how your week is going.

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:40.226
Clear it, and you're back on your map.

00:21:42.920 --> 00:21:44.810
Chapter 12. The timeline.

00:21:48.850 --> 00:21:51.995
Along the bottom is the timeline. Slide it left to look back.

00:21:54.630 --> 00:21:59.907
You see what really happened, week by week: touches you logged, closings, new people and referrals.

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:08.744
Slide right to look ahead: birthdays, anniversaries, open houses and follow-ups coming due.

00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:13.581
Tap Today and you're back to now.

00:22:15.890 --> 00:22:17.909
Chapter 13. Watch Pulse work.

00:22:19.300 --> 00:22:23.843
Watch Pulse work plays your own day as a short film: what Pulse lined up, and why.

00:22:27.030 --> 00:22:31.864
Chapter fourteen. Team: for team leads, everything to run your team from one place.

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:38.815
Open Team and your agents sit round it, each with this week's score.

00:22:43.710 --> 00:22:49.071
The leaderboard: names, photos and weekly scores, full screen for the office TV.

00:22:53.480 --> 00:22:59.757
The war room shows the team's leads as they come in: where each came from, who has it, and how fast they reached them.

00:23:07.560 --> 00:23:11.380
Onboarding follows new members through their first thirty days, step by step.

00:23:16.030 --> 00:23:22.850
Click an agent to see their week: score, VIP touches, commitments kept, and how fast they reach their leads.

00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:33.851
And when you add someone to the team, everything turns on for them at once: their seat, their products, their site and their team page.

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:39.167
Chapter 15. My Profile.

00:23:46.100 --> 00:23:49.810
Your photo, top right, opens My Profile: one profile for the whole system.

00:23:52.270 --> 00:23:56.515
Your details sit in two columns, used by every product, so you only type them once.

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:06.053
Connections links Google for your contacts' photos and your calendar, and reZEN for your revenue share.

00:24:09.310 --> 00:24:12.026
Badges shows every badge, earned and still to earn.

00:24:15.100 --> 00:24:24.015
In Pulse, you choose how each Pulse worker runs: Off, Ask me, where Pulse drafts and you tap send, or Autopilot. Every one starts Off.

00:24:27.130 --> 00:24:29.484
And Settings holds your notifications and your plan and billing.

00:24:32.130 --> 00:24:33.864
Chapter 16. The menu.

00:24:38.910 --> 00:24:40.315
Next to your photo is your menu.

00:24:43.480 --> 00:24:49.496
My website opens your site and its builder. Growth results shows the leads, appointments and closings from your ads.

00:24:52.700 --> 00:24:55.834
Team leads see the team website and the ad requests from their agents.

00:24:59.560 --> 00:25:03.833
My plan and billing, the help key, and Classic view for ONE MOVE's older screens.

00:25:06.520 --> 00:25:06.998
That's ONE.

00:25:11.740 --> 00:25:15.358
Plan on the desktop, do on your phone, and let Pulse watch the rest.

00:25:18.310 --> 00:25:23.609
Red, now. Yellow, today. Green, all good. Follow the pulse.
